WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:27.450
Tommy Brock and Red Fox chased each other.

2
00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:35.922
They ran all around the den.

3
00:00:35.923 --> 00:00:39.277
Flopsy hopped back to her hiding spot.

4
00:00:39.278 --> 00:00:43.109
Then Tommy ran out of the den.

5
00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:51.794
Red Fox chased him.

6
00:00:51.795 --> 00:00:57.252
The two animals ran into the woods.

7
00:00:57.253 --> 00:01:03.345
Flopsy flew out of her hiding spot.

8
00:01:03.346 --> 00:01:06.055
She hopped into the den.

9
00:01:06.056 --> 00:01:12.028
"Mopsy?" Flopsy called. "Cotton-tail?"

10
00:01:12.029 --> 00:01:15.942
"Help!" Mopsy cried.

11
00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:20.070
Cotton-tail banged hard on the oven door.

12
00:01:20.071 --> 00:01:26.040
"We're in here!" she said.

13
00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:28.987
Flopsy raced to the oven.

14
00:01:28.987 --> 00:01:31.018
She opened the door.

15
00:01:31.019 --> 00:01:44.131
"Flopsy!" her sisters cried.

16
00:01:44.131 --> 00:01:47.559
The rabbits ran outside.

17
00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:53.686
Tommy was still fighting with Red Fox.

18
00:01:53.687 --> 00:01:59.725
"Let's go home!" Flopsy said.

19
00:01:59.725 --> 00:02:08.423
The three bunnies hopped fast along the path.

20
00:02:08.423 --> 00:02:15.659
Soon they were home.

21
00:02:15.659 --> 00:02:18.881
"Thank you, Flopsy," Mopsy said.

22
00:02:18.882 --> 00:02:24.145
"You saved us!" Cotton-tail said.

23
00:02:24.146 --> 00:02:27.638
Flopsy frowned at her sisters.

24
00:02:27.638 --> 00:02:31.872
"Never sneak out again!" she said.

25
00:02:31.872 --> 00:02:35.975
"We won't," Mopsy and Cotton-tail said.

26
00:02:35.975 --> 00:02:40.069
"Good," Flopsy said.

27
00:02:40.069 --> 00:02:43.436
She picked up the dusters and smiled.

28
00:02:43.437 --> 00:03:09.372
"Now let's finish cleaning!"
